     1,
     "\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<div>\r\n<div style=\"direction:ltr;font-family:Tahoma;color:#000000;font-size:12pt\">\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Times New Roman;color:#000000;font-size:16px\">\r\n<div>\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\"><font face=\"Verdana\">Dear all,</font></div>\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><br>\r\n</font></div>\r\n<font face=\"Verdana\">please save the dates 27 June - 1 July 2022. This is when next year&#39;s ISEC will be taking place in the breathtaking venue of Cape Town; see below.<br>\r\n</font></div>\r\n<div><font face=\"Verdana\"><br>\r\n</font>\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\"><font face=\"Verdana\">Best regards  --- Marc<br>\r\n</font>\r\n<div><font face=\"Verdana\"></font>\r\n<div class=\"gmail_quote\"><br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"gmail_quote\"><br>\r\n<u></u>\r\n<div bgcolor=\"#F1F1F3\"><img src=\"https://ci6.googleusercontent.com/proxy/Mg2rYrxl9ZlWZhWvn9P2F-8QoPWeiqasbfNpMEV7tQRAHcjhvN1At97ZfV_dRunGM8BLBPLbe7vIvJB24426VUJwUSP8tG1WJBLJodfQp5LwaaPnFnOrPH2VKc6CKe5JEkXPUoZPyfikZMeM6LZpF-6inbhl7vVQ_x-Q02tJqTQ5CRe25g=s0-d-e1-ft#https://live1.evread1.net/s/r/234972/1117557/170838884/1.gif?m=xaaNd1qOzdiP8rFo&amp;h=f18030d7cda8c9dc0df1016b0282e31f\" alt=\"\" style=\"display:block\" width=\"1\" height=\"1\">\r\n<table style=\"font-family:Arial,&#39;sans-serif&#39;;font-size:16px\" width=\"800\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" bgcolor=\"#FFFFFF\" align=\"center\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"line-height:7px\" align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://soafrica-host2.pmailer.net/servlet/link/234972/1117557/170838884/5742794\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://soafrica-host2.pmailer.net/servlet/link/234972/1117557/170838884/5742794&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792449870739000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2B1jJpduQJCK_41rnEwRcn\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://ci5.googleusercontent.com/proxy/jm9OS9-Q74asFnLFIU4TlsR5vwiLURKBVGQA9U9bocO26FEOvqI0Hu95vQyio1R-X0_1y-nqW4dxMDqbRqxECHf7W8Vti7VH1z3duff7rpi9mUqiaqtkN8VcsizW9w=s0-d-e1-ft#https://d2y0ltxfpojlex.cloudfront.net/users/assets/304/images/Isec_logo.jpg\" width=\"600\" height=\"142\"></a><br>\r\n<a href=\"http://soafrica-host2.pmailer.net/servlet/link/234972/1117557/170838884/5742795\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://soafrica-host2.pmailer.net/servlet/link/234972/1117557/170838884/5742795&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792449870739000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0279kBvMfvqJAgcxdC__CK\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://ci3.googleusercontent.com/proxy/rycF_xRIPZtrJYzQdxECX1vX-V_CQJMvLUS2PsIOyEHMfYAWumqFiQyeUV9n9ErIQuUjqFqgt9xpH82QbMIx1b-tlul60uoqrGxzkXCN9iTsv3ZkPrp_RxpjY3rVJzNpneIHyVTwtjgzW4NIOOO1776hVL2p5A=s0-d-e1-ft#https://d2y0ltxfpojlex.cloudfront.net/users/assets/304/images/A-view-of-Table-Mountain-at-night.jpg\" style=\"min-height:276px;width:800px\" width=\"800\" height=\"276\"></a></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"30\" height=\"30\"></td>\r\n<td width=\"740\"></td>\r\n<td width=\"30\"></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"30\"></td>\r\n<td width=\"740\">We are excited to announce the International Statistical Ecology Conference (ISEC) in Cape Town , South Africa, from 27 June to 1 July 2022, hosted by the centre for Statistics in Ecology, Environment and Conservation (SEEC) at the University\r\n of Cape Town. The conference will be in hybrid format with an in-person meeting in Cape Town and an option to participate remotely.\r\n<h3>Confirmed Plenary Speakers</h3>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li><b>Iadine Chades</b>, <i>CSIRO Brisbane, Australia: Decision analysis and adaptive management for conservation</i>\r\n</li><li><b>Olivier Gimenez</b>, <i>CNRS Montpellier, France: Statistical ecology, hidden Markov models and the management of large carnivores in Europe</i>\r\n</li><li><b>Beth Gardner</b>, <i>University of Washington, USA: Spatial capture-recapture</i>\r\n</li><li><b>Joseph Ogutu</b>, <i>University of Hohenheim, Germany: Hierarchical Bayesian state-space modeling of age-and sex-structured wildlife population dynamics</i>\r\n</li></ol>\r\n<a href=\"http://soafrica-host2.pmailer.net/servlet/link/234972/1117557/170838884/5742796\" style=\"color:#43594f\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://soafrica-host2.pmailer.net/servlet/link/234972/1117557/170838884/5742796&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792449870740000&amp;usg=AOvVaw26MI2xzIfgnTN15ZYcXJDZ\"><b>Add The Dates To Your Calendar</b></a><br>\r\nClick here to add the dates to your calendar to make sure you don’t miss out!<br>\r\n<br>\r\n<b><a href=\"http://soafrica-host2.pmailer.net/servlet/link/234972/1117557/170838884/5742797\" style=\"color:#43594f\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://soafrica-host2.pmailer.net/servlet/link/234972/1117557/170838884/5742797&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792449870740000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1NAlRLj6UUho1GoPZwLTlW\">Sign Up To Our Mailing List</a></b>\r\n<h3>Call For Workshops, Skills Showcases &amp; Round Table Discussions Applications</h3>\r\n<b>Closing date for applications:</b><br>\r\n \r\n<table style=\"font-family:Arial,&#39;sans-serif&#39;\" width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"5\" border=\"0\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td bgcolor=\"#F8F8F8\"><b>Workshops</b></td>\r\n<td bgcolor=\"#F8F8F8\">Friday, 18 June 2021</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><b>Skills Showcases</b></td>\r\n<td>Wednesday, 1 September 2021</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td bgcolor=\"#F8F8F8\"><b>Round Table Discussions</b></td>\r\n<td bgcolor=\"#F8F8F8\">Wednesday, 1 September 2021</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<br>\r\n<br>\r\nYou are invited to submit proposals to host a workshop or side meeting linked to the ISEC 2022 Conference.\r\n<h3>Formats</h3>\r\n<b>Workshops:</b> we are planning to hold a series of half- or full-day workshops over the weekend before the conference, i.e. 25 - 26 June 2022, following the tradition of earlier ISEC iterations. These workshops tend to be very popular and are an excellent\r\n opportunity to teach your favourite method / R package / topic in statistical ecology to an eager audience. Participants will sign up for these workshops for an extra fee through our registration system. We will help organise and promote these workshops. Any\r\n profit is for the presenter.<br>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>Skills showcase:</b> these are short (1.5 hours) training sessions meant to bring your fellow statistical ecologists up to speed on the latest developments in your favourite method / R package / topic in statistical ecology. These sessions are part of the\r\n scientific programme and delegates can sign up at no extra cost.<br>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>Round-table discussion:</b> these are sessions that will bring together delegates interested in discussing a particular topic and are part of the scientific programme.<br>\r\n<br>\r\n \r\n<table style=\"font-family:Arial,&#39;sans-serif&#39;\" width=\"95%\" cellspacing=\"10\" cellpadding=\"5\" border=\"0\" align=\"center\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"25%\" align=\"center\"></td>\r\n<td width=\"50%\" bgcolor=\"#EABF13\" align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://soafrica-host2.pmailer.net/servlet/link/234972/1117557/170838884/5742798\" style=\"color:#ffffff;text-decoration:none\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://soafrica-host2.pmailer.net/servlet/link/234972/1117557/170838884/5742798&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792449870740000&amp;usg=AOvVaw14SQ8Y22dPM7X2-MEVDgn5\">Apply to host a workshop / side\r\n meeting</a></td>\r\n<td width=\"25%\" align=\"center\"></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n \r\n<h3>Important Dates</h3>\r\n<table style=\"font-family:Arial,&#39;sans-serif&#39;\" width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"5\" border=\"0\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td bgcolor=\"#F8F8F8\"><b>Workshop applications close</b></td>\r\n<td bgcolor=\"#F8F8F8\">18 June 2021</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><b>Abstract submissions open</b></td>\r\n<td>1 September 2021</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td bgcolor=\"#F8F8F8\"><b>Registration opens</b></td>\r\n<td bgcolor=\"#F8F8F8\">1 November 2021</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><b>Abstract submission closes</b></td>\r\n<td>9 December 2021</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td bgcolor=\"#F8F8F8\"><b>Early bird registration closes</b></td>\r\n<td bgcolor=\"#F8F8F8\">1 April 2022</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<br>\r\n<br>\r\nWe are hoping to see you at ISEC2022,<br>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>Res Altwegg</b> <i>(Co-Chair Local Organising Committee and Scientific Planning Committee)</i><br>\r\n<b>Greg Distiller</b> <i>(Co-Chair Local Organising Committee)</i><br>\r\n<b>David Warton</b> <i>(Co-Chair Scientific Planning Committee)</i><br>\r\n </td>\r\n<td width=\"30\"></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td colspan=\"3\" height=\"20\" bgcolor=\"#445950\" align=\"center\"></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"color:#ffffff\" bgcolor=\"#445950\" align=\"center\"><b>Conference Secretariat</b><br>\r\nScatterlings Conference &amp; Events<br>\r\n<a href style=\"color:#ffffff;text-decoration:none\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" data-email-masked>ca...@soafrica.com</a> | Tel: <a href=\"tel:+27%2021%20422%202402\" value=\"+27214222402\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">+27 (0)21 422 2402</a> | Fax: <a href=\"tel:+27%2086%20620%204555\" value=\"+27866204555\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">+27 (0)86 620 4555</a><br>\r\n<br>\r\n<a href=\"http://soafrica-host2.pmailer.net/servlet/link/234972/1117557/170838884/5742799\" style=\"color:#eabf13;letter-spacing:2px;text-decoration:none;text-transform:uppercase\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://soafrica-host2.pmailer.net/servlet/link/234972/1117557/170838884/5742799&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792449870740000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1u0Ns-jMI4hWobvnRRSFC8\"><b>www.isec2022.org</b></a></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td colspan=\"3\" height=\"20\" bgcolor=\"#445950\" align=\"center\"></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\nb <br>\r\n<br>\r\n<table style=\"background:#fefefe;border-collapse:collapse;border-spacing:0;width:100%\" bgcolor=\"#FEFEFE\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-collapse:collapse!important;margin:0;padding:0;text-align:center;vertical-align:top\" valign=\"top\" align=\"center\">\r\n<center>\r\n<table style=\"background:#fefefe;border-collapse:collapse;border-spacing:0;margin:0 auto;padding:0;text-align:inherit;vertical-align:top;width:100%\" bgcolor=\"#FEFEFE\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr style=\"padding:0;text-align:left;vertical-align:top\" align=\"left\">\r\n<td style=\"background:#fefefe;border:0px solid #fefefe;border-collapse:collapse!important;color:#8b8b8b;font-family:&#39;Helvetica&#39;,&#39;Arial&#39;,sans-serif;font-size:12px;font-weight:300;line-height:19px;margin:0;padding:16px;text-align:center;vertical-align:middle;word-wrap:break-word\" valign=\"top\" bgcolor=\"#FEFEFE\" align=\"center\">\r\n<center>\r\n<table style=\"width:auto;text-align:center;max-width:580px\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"padding:0px;margin:0 auto;float:none;text-align:center;vertical-align:top;border-top:1px solid #e1e1e1;padding-top:10px\" align=\"center\">\r\n<table width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"text-align:center;padding:0px 0px 10px;vertical-align:middle;margin:0;color:#8b8b8b;font-family:&#39;Helvetica&#39;,&#39;Arial&#39;,sans-serif;font-size:12px;font-weight:normal;line-height:19px\" width=\"100%\" align=\"center\">\r\n<a href=\"http://soafrica-host2.pmailer.net/public/contacts/unsubscribe/rKMZ0lkB7uW7ecE7/xaaNd1qOzdiP8rFo/e3133a2c1404767c\" style=\"color:#8b8b8b;text-decoration:none\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https